From 5072dcdba5748f2c72a05b3f284835a115a48c72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 02:17:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] R22 throughput and audit follow-up

- exact trace compilation on gmpy2.mpq (identical digests, 3x faster); runtime r22_gmpy2_v1
- INTEGRATION_POLICY_R22: enclosure ladders disabled per user decision, candidate search from order 8,
  per-process coefficient caches, unordered cell scheduling with owner reassembly
- PAIR_GATE_POLICY_R22: strict gate reported, production gate 1e-6 decides
- two-lane production pipeline with pair audit sampling and post-packet array retirement
- signed response errors in qualification; execution target selectable by configuration
- test basename collisions removed; honest full-tree test summary; scaling probe
- retire_sample tool and archived large sealed JSON records
